{"ID":"20240220132607-9uqepvs","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132607-9uqepvs","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132607-9uqepvs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171054-5lhnwt7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171054-ybnxr2j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:443,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171054-ybnxr2j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:52,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:52\u0026#125;","title":"【麻黄连翘赤小豆汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171054-5lhnwt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-5lhnwt7","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百七十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-lq7dkw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-lq7dkw8","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」身黄发热者，「麻黄连翘赤小豆汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-wfm307r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-wfm307r","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个除了身黄以外，我们治疗皮肤病，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很多皮肤病都会使用到麻黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻黄是发阳，阳气的阶段，所以还魂救逆汤，病人失魂的时候，麻黄下去把他救回来，但不是单开一个麻黄啊，所以开麻黄会开杏仁在里面，比如开麻黄三钱，杏仁最少三钱和麻黄等量。这样下去绝对不会说汗太过。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-sqn9qmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-sqn9qmk","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会用到麻黄，治疗一些比如一些疮病，尤其是凹陷下去的疮，如果是平头或者凸起来的疮都很好治。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"疮凹下去了，阳陷下去的疮很危险。这个时候麻黄下去，阳会浮起来，会发阳出来。所以阳气会发起来。刺激他的阳气发起来就要靠麻黄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-q2sdn3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-q2sdn3c","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以光是青龙，我们放到太阳篇的时候有麻黄汤，配合杏仁桂枝，炙甘草。放到少阴篇或者阳明篇的时候，还会用到麻黄，后面阴症还是会用到麻黄。所以麻黄是发阳用的，麻黄本身是阳药，他不像桂枝，光会发汗，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄除了发汗，它有阳的性在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以用麻黄不一定会出汗，有时候要小便解，汗吐下，下就包括了小便，所以在全身水肿的时候也会用到麻黄，一下去水就退掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-ecqkbfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-ecqkbfg","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要记得使用麻黄的时候，麻黄跟杏仁的剂量是相等的。不会有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-2pxjfz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-2pxjfz7","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆在腹膜炎的时候，赤小豆要发芽用。赤小豆本身去湿很好的药物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆去湿，大部分是化脓的湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以痔疮可以用赤小豆。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-yix20rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-yix20rj","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人痔疮，不用管便秘不便秘，都会下仁剂在里面，有便秘的话用大黄芒硝，痔疮的地方是每天都要使用的地方，等于是说车子在开的时候你要在开车的中间把车子修好，所以要在他每天使用的状态下同时让他大便收口，所以一定要他大便软化。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用赤小豆收敛的时候加一些仁剂，如果他大便不是很好，当归吃多一点可以利大便，柏子仁，麻子仁可以通利大便，在治痔疮的时候，保持他大便比较溏泻，比较稀的。如果光开痔疮药，没有把大便变软，痔疮不会好。硬大便一通过就会把痔疮撑破"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-xn50cht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-xn50cht","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄连翘赤小豆汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-yqqtwbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-yqqtwbz","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄二两。赤小豆一升。连翘二两炙。杏仁四十个去皮尖。大枣十二劈。生梓白皮一升去节。生姜二两。甘草二两炙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-3faiyia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-3faiyia","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右八味，以潦水一升，先煮麻黄再沸，去上沫，纳诸药，煮取三升，去滓，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-vlmu9rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-vlmu9rv","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分温三服，半日服尽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-1npj2dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-1npj2dx","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生梓白皮现在没有了，用桑白皮取代它"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个除了全身发黄，兼有表症以外，有点伤寒表症以外，皮肤病都可以使用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在经方里面，这是一个治皮肤病的方子。还有一个麻杏苡甘汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-s2afxv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-s2afxv2","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黄连翘赤小豆汤一般用在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"疥疮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，皮肤有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"癣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"疮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，皮肤科。麻黄性非常轻，连翘桑白皮对皮肤非常好，可是需要一个东西把它带过去，金银花，蝉兑对皮肤都很好，主方是这个，这个是去黄疸的。针对皮肤的时候可以加一些皮肤的药，以经方做基础方增加，在这个基础方上面再加一些药上去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171054-ybnxr2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171054-ybnxr2j","updated":"20240312171054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从处方看，这个是因为伤寒表症，束到，热排不出去，造成全身发黄，用发汗的药去。实际这个条辨不应该在阳明篇。"}]}]}